t be positive.\",\r\n              \" Value of groups:\", groups);\r\n  TORCH_CHECK((c % groups) == 0,\r\n              \"Number of channels must be divisible by groups. Got \",\r\n              c, \" channels and \", groups, \" groups.\");`\r\n\r\nThese checks are done in the function below and I think it makes sense to just add them to the function that gets called (channel_shuffle_cpu).\r\nhttps://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/blob/2ed4d65af0a1993c0df7b081f4088d0f3614283e/aten/src/ATen/native/ChanelShuffle.cpp#L38","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytorch/pytorch/issues/comments/2565007766/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"abcarlisle","id":156453508,"node_id":"U_kgDOCVNKhA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/156453508?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abcarlisle","html_url":"https://github.com/abcarlisle","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abcarlisle/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abcarlisle/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abcarlisle/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abcarlisle/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abcarlisle/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abcarlisle/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abcarlisle/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abcarlisle/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abcarlisle/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"actor":{"login":"abcarlisle","id":156453508,"node_id":"U_kgDOCVNKhA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/156453508?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abcarlisle","html_url":"https